00:23:48.390 --> 00:23:48.900
<i>Love!</i>

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:49.650
<i>Courage!</i>

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:51.860
<i>True friendship shall shine bright!</i>

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:54.120
<i>Cleaving the dark and purging evil!</i>

00:23:54.120 --> 00:23:55.580
